<b>

<CENTER>
UNITED STATES<br>
DEPARTMENT OF LABOR<br>
MINE SAFETY AND HEALTH ADMINISTRATION<br>
Metal and Nonmetal Mine Safety and Health
<br><br>
REPORT OF INVESTIGATION
<br><br>
Surface Nonmetal Mine<br>
(Limestone)
<br><br>
Fatal Electrical Accident<br>
<br>
July 27, 2006
<br><br>
Adams Trucking Co., Inc.<br>
Contractor I.D. No. 6MH<br>
at<br>
Specialty Minerals Inc.<br>
Adams Mine<br>
Adams, Berkshire County, Massachusetts<br>
Mine I.D. No. 19-00035 
<br><br>
Investigators
<br><br>
Daniel F. Pullen<br>
Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
Guy A. Constant<br>
Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
James R. Logan<br>
Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
Thomas D. Barkand<br>
