<b><div align="center">APPENDIX A</div></b>
<br>
<b>Persons Participating in the Investigation</b>
<br><br>
<b><u>Specialty Minerals, Inc.</u></b>

	<blockquote>Dave Buttelman .......... environmental manager<br>
	Leon Parrott .......... health and safety manager<br>
	David Ferris .......... regional manager, human resources<br>
	James Mulkey .......... director, manufacturing operations<br>
